WEBVTT

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:37.950
H-Hibachi-dono!

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.450
Tsukishima!

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.490
I'll save you right away, Hibachi-dono...

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.900
What are you doing, stupid Tsukishima?

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.830
Wh-What is this?

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.340
Don't fall for his illusions!

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.690
Huh? Illusions?

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:09.730
I expected that personally killing

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:13.610
a scum-woman like you 
would be unnecessary...

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.380
What? That was illusion?

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:20.480
Looks like you fought like another idiot.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.790
Yes...

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:26.120
Everything is to defeat Sanada Yukimura, 
waiting inside the castle.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:29.310
We mustn't stay here.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.730
Ah...

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:32.630
Not bad.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.500
Huh?

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:44.140
Tsukishima, just watch how I fight.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.670
Leader of the Ten Crucifix Insects, 
Kirigakure Saizou...

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:54.150
I'll defeat you and prove that 
I'm the strongest ninja!

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:59.150
<b>Dream of the Butterfly</b>

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:06.740
Fool!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:12.710
Oh, you're moving more quickly...

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.630
Then I hope you'll let me have some fun!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.460
<i>I can easily tell.</i>

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.480
<i>I'm completely different 
than I was a second ago...</i>

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:28.540
<i>My body is light, like cotton fluff.</i>

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:32.900
<i>My thoughts are as clear as Akame Falls.</i>

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.780
<i>And I feel so good!</i>

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.050
<i>Thousand Bladed Flowers!</i>

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.870
<i>What's making me so powerful is...</i>

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.710
That's so wonderful, Hibachi-dono!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:57.120
Your techniques,

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.500
your stance, your explosives.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.220
I've seen them somewhere...

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:05.510
But I can't remember where.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.820
The strong don't have so much free time

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.230
that they can remember the weak.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:13.920
You don't need to remember,

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.770
Kirigakure Saizou!

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.670
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms: Ten Lotuses!</i>

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.990
Add the "-sama," scum-woman!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.540
<i>Dissonance Wall!</i>

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.250
You used sound to make a wall, huh?

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:32.830
Then how about this?

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.220
Pierce through...

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.130
<i>Princess Privet!</i>

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:47.900
Th-This is...

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.860
You've finally revealed it...

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:54.950
One of the Iga ninjutsu techniques, 
whose use was forbidden,

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:58.020
lest it be turned to evil ends.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.520
The Fog Teleport technique.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.010
You know the forbidden techniques?

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.530
I do.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:10.460
I know about the secret scroll you stole 
from your master when you killed him,

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.540
back when you were still human.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.400
<i>Forbidden techniques?</i>

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:18.040
<i>I didn't know there were scary 
techniques like those.</i>

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:19.170
<i>Yes.</i>

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:23.970
<i>Thus, the scroll containing 
them was kept hidden.</i>

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:28.180
<i>But one day, it was stolen from my master.</i>

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.180
<i>By that man...</i>

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.640
<i>That man?</i>

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.520
<i>The man who studied under the same master,</i>

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:39.690
<i>and who was my rival as a ninja...</i>

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.690
<i>Kirigakure Saizou.</i>

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:47.700
<i>Kirigakure Saizou?</i>

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:51.040
That was over a century ago...

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:56.210
Then I guess you know someone related to me.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:01.840
Though they're probably so weak 
I've utterly forgotten them.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:09.300
But I clearly remember the day I killed my master.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:15.840
The weakling told me he couldn't 
teach me the forbidden techniques.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:17.640
That foolish man.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:22.350
I was by far a better ninja than he.

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:28.320
Just remembering it makes my blood run hot.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.330
Tearing the life out of the man reputed to be

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:34.810
the strongest ninja in Iga with my own hands...

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.210
Please be careful, Hibachi-dono...

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.870
The Insect-men can transform.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:59.100
I haven't been in this form
 in a very long time.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.050
This pressure...

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.860
So you're finally serious.

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:11.750
Scum-woman,

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:16.290
my forbidden techniques 
will now take your life.

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:19.750
What?

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.200
H-Hibachi-dono!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.070
You used pain to overcome the illusion?

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:44.860
I'll admit you have guts, if nothing else.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.860
But this next one won't be so easy.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.540
I'll show you the power

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:52.110
of the forbidden technique 
that melds dream and reality!

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:57.530
Hibachi!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.500
G-Grandpa?

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.390
Where did you come from?

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.390
Are you okay, Hibachi?

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.290
Y-Yeah.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:17.950
You're crazy, for one so inexperienced.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.270
<i>My grandfather can't be here.</i>

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:30.890
When I helped you train,
 we often did this...

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.460
Your brothers used to say I shouldn't let you

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.430
become scarred before your marriage.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.090
Yeah, that's right.

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.670
That will do.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:47.990
Thank you, Grandpa.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:51.550
I should be the one to thank you.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:56.750
When you decided to take up the 
Chinpou style, I didn't agree.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:01.310
But I was wrong.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:06.640
You have mastered my techniques.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.570
I am very grateful now.

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:14.320
Thank you, Hibachi.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:16.760
Grandpa!

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:20.680
This is where you are, scum?

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.430
Now, let us defeat him.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:28.280
Together, I'm certain you and I can defeat him.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:29.170
Yes.

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:33.020
<i>My grandfather accepted me!</i>

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.890
When everything is over, 
let's return to the village.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:40.430
I want a relaxing life with you.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:45.430
I'm going to quit being a ninja...

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.540
The two of us can live in peace.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:54.190
You must be a fake.

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:02.480
The forbidden technique "Dream of the Butterfly"

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.950
shows the dreamer a dream 
from which they never wake.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.460
How could a scum-woman 
like you break through it?

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:15.790
My grandfather would never admit something 
so weak as wanting to relax.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.220
He's a ninja till the day he dies!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.470
Kirigakure Saizou,

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:24.720
I shall defeat you in my grandfather's place!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.900
Keep your trap shut, weakling!

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.280
It's useless, scum-woman.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:42.140
You cannot touch me.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:44.830
<i>This illusion...</i>

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:48.710
<i>My techniques pass through,
 while his connect.</i>

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.600
<i>There's no odor.</i>

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:53.730
<i>He isn't creating the illusion with a drug.</i>

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.330
Saizou!

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.530
You fell for another illusion?

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.650
How many times can you fall for that,

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:20.570
stupid Tsukishima?

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.870
Just wake up!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.720
It's useless.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.870
Nothing you say will be heard.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.880
Hibachi-dono, I'll save you right away!

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.170
Saizou!

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.350
What's wrong, scum-woman?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.560
If you don't fight to kill him, he'll kill you.

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.800
Hibachi-dono, are you okay?

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:07.790
The illusion broke?

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.610
Curse you, Saizou!

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.530
So useless that you cannot even kill each other.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.750
Enough... Begone!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.660
H-Hibachi-dono?

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:31.310
Hibachi-dono! There you are...

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.110
I'll save you at once!

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.060
Tsukishima?

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:36.560
Hibachi-dono!

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.570
Tsukishima!

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.070
That fool...

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:45.330
To risk his life for something so stupid.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:51.080
Of course, it's a pathetic death, 
one suited to a weakling.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:52.910
Shut up.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.040
<i>Secret Technique:</i>

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.810
<i>Fire Peony Blast!</i>

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.140
The world is impermanent, ephemeral.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:11.290
Time never stops in its flow.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.450
Life is like the bubbles in a stream,

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:18.150
appearing and then disappearing an instant later.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.260
<i>Balsam Bomb!</i>

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.450
Let's get going.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.790
I'll go kick some butt.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:41.980
Come on out, Insect-men!

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.300
Come out, come out, wherever you are!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.270
<i>The plan is working.</i>

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:51.960
<i>As we buy time, the Snow Group 
should be advancing safely.</i>

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:33.720
Too bad...

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.910
I told you, didn't I?

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:40.730
That you couldn't touch me.

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:43.480
Hibachi-dono!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:51.410
H-Hibachi-dono!

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.290
Hibachi-dono...

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.690
Hibachi-dono!

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.210
Shut up, stupid Tsukishima!

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:04.830
Hibachi-dono!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.390
I said to shut up!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.680
Sound?

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.930
I get it... It's sound!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:24.470
You're using the sound of your wings 
to cast your illusions, right?

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:29.950
Through the ears, sound affects 
the body in many ways...

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:33.070
It can hypnotize people,

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:35.830
affect their sight or balance,

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.330
or make it seem that an 
attack passes through you.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:53.050
Knowing that won't help you one bit.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.560
Hibachi-dono!

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:03.480
Hibachi-dono!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.440
Hibachi-dono...

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:15.530
Tsukishima!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.890
Finally, it's quiet.

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:25.930
You two pieces of scum can go 
to the next world together.

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.770
The real world belongs to the strong.

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:32.550
They are those who survive!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:37.680
The weak are destined to 
disappear and be forgotten.

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:40.560
Including you and your ninjutsu style.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.200
<i>I'm sorry, Grandpa...</i>

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.780
Hibachi-dono!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.450
Tsukishima...

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.820
I was almost there.

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.450
I'm so sorry!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.460
Tsukishima Jinbei is on his way!

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:13.470
He struggles uselessly, and he dies uselessly...

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:19.850
It is a sad thing, being weak.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.350
Tsukishima, weak?

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:26.100
Is that how he looks to you?

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.400
What nonsense is this?

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:34.400
Tsukishima is really stupid.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:38.660
But even if he's totally outclassed,

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.910
he'll never give up!

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:43.730
If he needs to protect someone,

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:46.950
he'll fight the enemy, even if he can't stand.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:50.040
He's the strongest idiot there is!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.660
Hibachi-dono!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:00.520
What?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:03.070
I thought it was Hibachi-dono, 
but it's a pine tree!

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:06.310
After seeing that...

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.570
How could I not get fired-up?

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:19.960
Hibachi-dono!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.570
Where are you, Hibachi-dono?

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:27.060
My illusions were defeated 
not once, but twice?

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:31.840
When I saw you laughing at Tsukishima 
for being weak, I understood.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:36.720
Kirigakure Saizou, you aren't strong at all.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.260
You're just using forbidden techniques 
won through treachery

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.220
as though you earned them yourself.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.590
And you look down on others for weakness...

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:47.700
People like that shouldn't 
call themselves strong!

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:49.860
Hibachi-dono...

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:50.980
There you are!

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:54.470
Tsukishima Jinbei is on his way to aid you!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:04.550
Don't get cocky, scum!

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:12.380
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.590
<i>Plus Devil Princess Privet!</i>

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:22.850
Impossible...

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.000
Hibachi-dono...

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.610
That was amazing!

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.260
Thanks to you, I was saved.

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.090
Huh?

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.770
I said it was nothing!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:51.020
Because I'm trying to be the 
strongest ninja in Japan.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.040
I'll do my best, too...

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:59.750
I'll try even harder to be the 
strongest samurai in Japan!

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:05.790
<i>I still have a long way to go,</i>

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:08.250
<i>but I'm doing my best.</i>

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:12.300
<i>Alongside my first rival!</i>

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.470
<i>Well done.</i>

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:48.790
<i>I'm amazed I lost to the scum-woman.</i>

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:54.060
<i>Of course, that was the best they 
could do against my shadow.</i>

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:56.880
<i>In the end, they're only a group of weaklings.</i>

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:59.980
<i>We can ignore them, and they'll pose no threat.</i>

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.720
I never realized

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:05.990
there were so many secret 
passages deep within the castle.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.250
We are almost to the well.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:13.000
I must retake my power as soon as possible.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:17.370
<i>Retake her power?</i>

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:22.990
<i>Could she be the Princess?</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.610
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.390 --> 00:23:02.180
The Insect-men can take human form.

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:02.610
What?

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:04.190
There could be a female Insect-man?

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:04.590
What?

00:23:04.590 --> 00:23:07.160
Maybe one with big peaches, 
like Oharu-dono...

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:07.670
What?

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:08.920
Don't invent things!

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.700
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>The Compassion Slash That Cuts G!!</b>

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:14.000
The Compassion Slash That Cuts G.
